      "en": "but he didn’t respect Cain and his offering. Cain was very angry, and the expression on his face fell.",
      "ko": "가인과 그 제물은 열납하지 아니하신지라 가인이 심히 분하여 안색이 변하니",
      "source_text_hash": "a8e13f923a15fa5ceddecc03c4fccd2fd68a900462bfe1540d48ced3f629135d",
      "translation_text_hash": "8210582559f7a8e461a4c90e4f346e2d55a108944e72c0b4751d92586b69fe0e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
