      "en": "Cain said to Abel, his brother, “Let’s go into the field.” While they were in the field, Cain rose up against Abel, his brother, and killed him.",
      "ko": "가인이 그 아우 아벨에게 고하니라 그 후 그들이 들에 있을 때에 가인이 그 아우 아벨을 쳐 죽이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "270386e76eaeb8757fb0cf77a55f9d2fe5e62cc8522fac61f3b15f188ccd04a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "d79e75fb1533c614326ae80a65cd3d2fd387ecdb8c42756302a5d72a486a2d85",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
