      "en": "Cain said to the LORD, “My punishment is greater than I can bear.",
      "ko": "가인이 여호와께 고하되 내 죄벌이 너무 중하여 견딜 수 없나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "725e2b4e25bb6ee33b667a95ddeb7ce4c5b5b57bfaabe5de497095fab93c4c92",
      "translation_text_hash": "965817a2c677738bf0051f070eda97a45024f7b2419d61761fde62c54f71bf49",
